:db/id #edb/ref 17592186131755}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "234f294e-2580-53eb-91b4-3b4b0a28959b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186131753} :answer-field/id #uuid "0bfc79e7-c8e9-5c3c-a109-c8d47ef0c0d5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186131750}] :question/id #uuid "f9f2f2a5-47b5-5a66-9153-5085ab9c95cd" :question/math-academy-id "q-40503" :question/problem "$∭_(S)f(x, y, z)dV = ∫_{∗}^{∗}∫_{a}^{b}∫_{∗}^{∗}f(x, y, z)dydzdx$\n\nThe triple integral above is defined over the type III region given by\n$S = {(x, y, z): 0 \\le x \\le 1,-1 \\le z \\le 2x + 1, 0 \\le y \\le 1 + x + z}$.\nWhat is the value of $a + b$?"}]}
